      "readMeText": "Mark out the ruling lines by which a surface can be unrolled. Use util.SelectFace to pick a face off of a surface if necessary.\n\nStartFromEdge sets the direction of the ruling lines. Negative value results in automatic selection of edge which maximizes accuracy of the ruling lines to the original surface.",
